# Great Hall of the Biblioplex: "{5}: If this land isn't a creature, it becomes a 2/4 Wizard creature with 'Whenever you
# cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.' It's still a land." (CR 205.1b, 611.2a,
# 613). Turn 3: five Mox Rubies pay {5} and the Hall is a 2/4 Wizard land creature, for good (no duration). Turn 5: it is
# activated again - the Hall already is a creature, so nothing happens (a second grant of the trigger would pump it twice) -
# then it taps for its restricted {R} and a Lightning Bolt is cast: one trigger, +1/+0, the Hall is 3/4.

